  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, every version of a model you upload is in one big list. I would love to be able to make folders with pictures to categorize my models. \n\nFor example, I have the Minase Base. If I make a version of Minase with a leather jacket and also a version with a kimono, I would love a folder that I can label \"Minase\" that when clicked could show each version (with their unique outfits). This would make it easier to find the exact model I am looking for after uploading many different models and variants. \n\nWe all know that having one model with multiple outfit toggles is really taxing on a system. I believe having an easier way to categorize the outfits and variants would help to mitigate that.",
